id:                     E3182
trigger_tool: conan|make|test
phase: compile|testing
error_signature: upstream gtest: discovered=\d+ executed=\d+ passed=\d+ failed=\d+|HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT=\{[^}]*"status":"[^"]*"[^}]*"gaps"|Segmentation fault \(core dumped\).*eventlog_test|test_package_result_absent|rule4[^
]* passed 状态与上游结果矛盾
severity:               3
category:               ohos, build-system, autotools, testing
match_keywords: test_harness_integration, gap_evidence_release, status_three_state, only_real_failure_blocks, ohos_feature_gap, eventlog_tmp_ro, hmbs_upstream_test_result, test_package_absent
title: OHOS 真机将上游 gtest/自测接入 conan build()，以 HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT 三态 + gaps 证据放行，仅真实失败阻断
root_cause: 无 formal make check/ctest 或上游测试需原生工具链的 autotools/CMake 库，其上 npm/原生 make check 在 OHOS 真机不可直接运行；简单脚本不经统一计量会跑不全或漏报，且环境缺口（如只读 /tmp 使 eventlog 写路径段错误）与真实测试失败不分，导致要么伪造通过、要么误阻断
affected_scope: 在 OHOS 真机可运行的、自带 gtest/自测（如 JSON 行级 [ RUN ]/[ OK ]/[ FAILED ] 输出）的 autotools/CMake C/C++ 库，需将其接入 conan build() 作通用回归套件的库
verification_cmd: 真机日志保留真实 HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT（discovered/executed/passed/failed/skipped/gaps）与逐二进制退出码，gaps 证据（段错误日志 + 源码行）须连带；环境缺口只能带证据放行，不得伪造成 passed
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: add-upstream-tests-in-conan-build-harness
rec_description: 把上游 gtest/自测编入 conan build() 的 _run_upstream_tests，统一计量并上报 discovered/executed/passed/gaps；按三态 status（仅真实 failed 阻断，ohos_feature/environment gap 带证据放行为 incomplete）
rec_command: conanfile.py: _run_upstream_tests 逐二进制分日志运行、记录退出码、按 [ RUN ]/[ OK ]/[ FAILED ] 单数据源计数，输出 HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT；MANIFEST.yml: upstream_test_total 按独立盘点填写，gaps 如实列 count/category/detail/evidence
rec_auto_fix: true
rec_impl: conan-recipe-plus-evidence-gap-release
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: api-equivalent-substitute-test
fallback_description: 若上游测试依赖过多（如需要原生 gtest 工具链或设备缺失接口）无法在真机独立编译运行，保留失败审计记录，编写等价 API 断言式测试替代并计入新增测试
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT=\{[^}]*"status":"passed"[^}]*"skipped":[1-9]|HMBS_UPSTREAM_TEST_RESULT=\{[^}]*"status":"passed"[^}]*"gaps":\[.{1}
forbid_1_reason: 禁止 passed 与 skipped/gaps 并存；存在未 100% 执行或环境缺口时必须如实标注 incomplete（rule4 会拒绝 self-contradictory 的 passed），更不得把 ohos_feature 环境缺口伪造成通过
forbid_1_consequence: 真机预检 evidence incomplete，任务退回修复循环；伪造等待后仍会被 rule4 contradiction 门禁否决
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-lcm-1.3.11-upstream-tests-in-conan-build-three-state-release.md
last_updated: 2026-09-29
source_event: lcm/1.3.11 真机预检上游 gtest 接入与 ohos_feature /tmp 只读 gap 带证据放行并修正 status 三态语义
authors: hmbs-executor
source_pr: 13669
